 "_note": "(11-18 f) v16 DIRECT student round 2 (user: \"do 1-5 altogether\", after the direct student v16d scored 46.9 % and shook 10-20x the teacher): (1) servo label fix: in student-driven worlds the alignment servo integrates the wrist error the LABEL command would give (this world's command -> wrist offset applied to FK of the label), not the student's own error (wound up to 32 mm median at the gate); align_servo.pred. (2) act_w_mult L_arm 0.16 (the idle left arm took 27-83 % of the loss). (3) student.prev_out_noise 0.05 (normalised; ~10 mrad on the right arm) on the previous-output inputs: no exact copying, the history still gives the commanded-vs-measured offset that closed-loop correction needs (zeroing them would make the 0.01 rad joint-offset DR unobservable). (4) smooth_w 5: (y_t - y_t-1) matched to (label_t - label_t-1). (5) direct_ema_alpha 0.25 on the executed absolute command (exact labels: 99.2 % at 0.5 and 0.25); ema_alpha stays 0.5 (the teacher's residual smoothing). Smoothness pairs on 1/4 of each minibatch (smooth_frac; memory). Teacher kin_p01v16gs_g3/final.pt; warm start: everything from student_p01v16d_g3/final.pt. | (11-19) student_p01v20d: direct student on task v20 from the kin_p01v20_g3 teacher, warm from student_p01v16d2_g3/final.pt (copied to warm_src.pt); same v16d2 recipe; times as kin_p01v20_g3; extras.arm_freeze from 13.6 s also locks the student's arm command to the reference (vega_extras.direct_arm_freeze): the runtime must stream the reference arm command from 13.6 s. | (11-19 b) student_p01v21d: direct student on task v21 (v20 made physical, see kin_p01v21_g3) from the kin_p01v21_g3 teacher, warm from student_p01v20d_g3/final.pt (copied to warm_src.pt); same recipe and times. | (11-20 j, user: \"based on c7, train a new student\") student_p01v21c7d: direct camera student distilled from kin_p01v21c7_g3 (thick fingers + condim 4 task v21t, FR 1 rad, contact-heavy reward); group_scale = c7's (FR 1.0; the direct student's outputs are absolute commands, so no output-row rescale); warm from student_p01v21d_g3/latest.pt (it 345, the stopped v21 student); 700 it; GPUs 0-2 shared with the c8 teacher run. | (11-20 l, user: \"the student finger limit should be 1 rad, not 0.25\") student_p01v21c7d2: the executed command was never limited to 0.25 rad (only the joint range) and the labels use FR 1.0, BUT the loss weight is (cmd_sd / group_scale)^2: FR 0.25 -> 1.0 cut the right fingers from 40.6 % to 4.1 % of the action loss (idle left fingers 27 %, right arm 66.5 %) -> the student did not learn the regrasp (tilt diverges only in 14.2-15.5 s). act_w_mult r_ x16 restores the FR-0.25 weighting (right fingers 40.6 %) with FR 1 rad of command range. Warm from student_p01v21c7d_g3 (latest), 400 it, beta 40 it, pushes ramp 0-100. | (11-20 n, user: \"not absolute, do relative student training\"; relative = to the reference, i.e. RESIDUAL) student_p01v21c7r: residual student (teacher action space: reference command + re-anchoring + a x group_scale, FR 1 rad) with its own descent \"go\" (extras.student.residual_go): its worlds run without the privileged alignment servo and gate truth; label = teacher action + servo / scale (vega_extras.residual_label). Unweighted MSE in action units except L_arm x0.16. Warm: depth encoder / proj / aux from student_p01v21c7d2 (MLP and normaliser fresh: new output meaning). 600 it, beta 60, pushes 30-150. Starts unchanged (89 % after the grasp). | (11-20 p, user: \"on the other two GPUs train: half of the episodes from 0 s\") student_p01v21c7r0 = c7r + starts: 1040 x frame 0 prepended to the 1040 old starts (duplicates are weights) -> 50 % of the episodes run the full task from 0 s (was 11 % before the grasp: the student rarely trained the regrasp after its OWN grasp; from a reference state at 7 s it scores 100 %). SD1 GPUs 5 6. | (11-20 q, user: \"make c7r know the reference trajectory as part of the observation\") student_p01v21c7rref = c7r0 (residual-go, 50 % frame-0 starts) with the d02-style deployable observation instead of no_ref: joint history + q_reference / base_command at t+0/2/5/12 control steps + plunger ref + phase + progress + object / holder measurements + re-anchoring arm delta + wrist_ref (reference wrist pose re-anchored with the estimate, relative to FK of the measured arm). Differs from c7r0 only in the observation. Replaces c7r (stopped at it ~60, no reference, 11 % frame-0). SD1 GPUs 0 1 2 4. | (11-20 v, user: \"teach the student with the c7 teacher scaled to 0.25, do not retrain the teacher\") student_p01v21c7rref25 = c7rref with group_scale FR 0.25: the c7 teacher (trained at FR 1) executed at 1/4 finger residual = what its FR-0.25 evals showed (100 % / 100 % push, natural middle finger; at FR 1 it bends the middle finger ~22 deg off the reference, 87.5 %). Teacher actions a are unchanged, so the whole network warm-starts from student_p01v21c7rref_g3 latest (it 166). 400 it, beta 40, pushes 0-100, SD1 GPUs 0 1 2 4 5 6. | (11-20 x, user: \"could the student training start from scratch rather than from any previous checkpoint\") student_p01v21c7rref25s = c7rref25 with NO warm start (depth encoder, MLP, normaliser from random init); from-scratch schedule: 700 it, beta 80 (lr floor at 240), pushes 50-250; SD1 GPUs 0 1 2 4 5 6. c7rref25 (warm) stopped at it 57.",
